From 36b423560e2e68a45879abcc3707a5eb6fcf3f36 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: r <r@r>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 03:52:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Second pass: D-1..D-5, B-2, B-3 (verifier honesty + safety
 fixes)

---
